    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "ANTIDIVA: The Carole Pope Confessions | Film screening |  Sat, Aug 22, 2026, 4:00 pm | Fourth Stage"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/41890/carole_pope__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join Carole Pope for an intimate discussion after the film.\n\n(Michelle Mama, 2026 / 83 mins / NR)\n\nCarole Pope shattered taboos with raw, unapologetic music and defiant sexuality—Antidiva tells the story of a queer rock icon reclaiming her rightful place in music history. \n\nCarole Pope’s fearless voice redefined Canadian rock and broke barriers for LGBTQ+ artists. Antidiva traces her journey from underground cult figure to celebrated pioneer, revealing never-before-seen archival footage, candid interviews, and a live performance. The film captures her ongoing fight for..."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "728780803"
      }
